@comment{
  Conference proceedings, exported from NASA ADS (https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu).

  1. Search: author:"Surname, A." doctype:inproceedings (add orcid:0000-0000-0000-0000 to avoid namesakes).
  2. Or filter "Publication type" → "Proceedings". If in doubt about conference abstracts, leave them out.
  3. Select all, then Export, then BibTeX, and paste the result below this block.

  Optional, per entry: a link to code or data, e.g.
    note = {\href{https://github.com/...}{code}},

  Leave this file without entries if you have no proceedings.

  FILL: paste the export below, then delete this line.
}
